    "collapsible_content_dat4aK": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_6AcTtR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is this Coffee Club you speak of?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It's a coffee subscription, sure, but it's more like... a big beautiful community of coffee lovers who want regular fresh-roasted specialty coffee deliveries AND MORE?! Members get all kinds of perks, but some big ones are: </p><ul><li>Automated delivery of up to 4 bags of coffee a week, hand-selected by our pro roasting team</li><li>An Onda Origins diner mug *on us* with your first order &lt;3</li><li>Free shipping every time (up to a $15 discount depending on where you live)</li><li>Monthly gifts and goodies, like merch and tasters of custom coffee blends/unreleased coffees</li><li>Monthly email newsletter with insider info, resources, and discounts</li><li>The knowledge that you're contributing in a real way to shifting grower access to revenue (<a href=\"https://ondaorigins.com/pages/onda-origins-coffee-story-seattle\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://ondaorigins.com/pages/onda-origins-coffee-story-seattle\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">more here</span></a>) and changing the specialty coffee industry.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jFrEKP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I signed up! When will I get my coffee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Hooray! Happy to have you. We process orders Monday thru Friday between 10a and noon PST, so that should help you gauge when we'll get your first order in the mail. The closer to Seattle you live, the sooner you'll see it, but you can pretty much count on your coffee arriving within 5 business days. And since we're shipping the same day we roast, this gives your beans the perfect amount of rest time. Email us at info@ondaorigins.com if you have specific questions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_aRzRed": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fresh is this coffee, really?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Preeeetty much couldn't be fresher. We roast and ship same-day, so it's literally hot off the press – er, machine. The few days it takes USPS to get you your beans is a great amount of time for the coffee to “rest.” In fact, we often recommend letting it \"rest\" a few days longer to best flavor... that's how fresh it is.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JWrNLy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I choose my coffees, or make requests?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The short answer is no, but read on. </p><p>Our Coffee Club relies on a “Roaster’s Choice” model meant for those who want to explore a range of varietals, processes, and origins – and who don’t want to have to make those decisions themselves. <br/><br/>If you’re more of the “I know what I like” type, you’re probably better off with our “Subscribe & Save” option, which lets you automate delivery for any specific coffee you choose. <br/><br/>To sign up for Sub & Save, just go to any coffee’s product page and choose “Subscribe & Save” before adding it to your cart. (You’ll get $3 off your bag every time!) <br/><br/>And if at some point you want to change it up, just cancel that original subscription and do it all over again with a new coffee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JBinwV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I cancel, pause, or skip a delivery on my membership?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! We use a streamlined, user-friendly membership portal that lets you change things up at any time, so go for it. You can request a unique, private login link<a href=\"https://ondaorigins.com/a/loop_subscriptions/customer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://ondaorigins.com/a/loop_subscriptions/customer\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>, or access your membership via your ondaorigins.com customer page. <br/><br/>And if you need help making changes, just email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@ondaorigins.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">info@ondaorigins.com</span></a> and we’ll get back to you asap.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zJFDpw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Something's gone awry! What do I do?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We're here for you Monday thru Friday, 9-4 PST! Just email us at info@ondaorigins.com and let us know what's up. We'll get back to you speedily - usually within 12 hours if it's a business day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
